\pard\sb200\sa60\f0\fs26\cf2\b What the editor does\par
\pard\sa50\li400\fi-240\f0\fs22 \u8226?   Rich text or plain text. Format and Font change the runs.\par
\pard\sa50\li400\fi-240\f0\fs22 \u8226?   Find, spelling, quotes, links, and data detectors sit on the view.\par
\pard\sa50\li400\fi-240\f0\fs22 \u8226?   Alignment, lists, and tab stops are paragraph styles.\par
\pard\sa50\li400\fi-240\f0\fs22 \u8226?   Pictures live in an RTFD package. A lone .rtf has none.\par
\pard\sb200\sa60\f0\fs26\cf2\b Autosave and versions\par
\pard\sa20\f0\fs22 NSDocument autosaves in place. Revert To walks NSFileVersion beside the file.\par
\pard\sa20\f0\fs22 Process home is /private/var/db/sftextedit/home. That is not a write into TextEdit.app.\par
